/E (The IPsec \(Internet Protocol Security\) VPN is a widely used protocol suite that secures network traffic by encrypting and authenticating IP packets at the network layer \(Layer 3\). It provides site-to-site and remote access solutions that ensure data confidentiality, integrity, and authenticity between two or more networks.)
