/T (SD-WAN \(Software-Defined Wide Area Network\) is an advanced networking technology that enhances WAN performance by intelligently directing traffic across multiple WAN connections \(such as MPLS, broadband, or LTE\). Integrating SD-WAN with VPN allows FortiGate devices to dynamically select the best path for VPN traffic based on real-time performance metrics. )
/E (SD-WAN \(Software-Defined Wide Area Network\) is an advanced networking technology that enhances WAN performance by intelligently directing traffic across multiple WAN connections \(such as MPLS, broadband, or LTE\). Integrating SD-WAN with VPN allows FortiGate devices to dynamically select the best path for VPN traffic based on real-time performance metrics. )
